WEBVTT

00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:34.332
I think with some hard work
this is an achievable reality.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:38.643
Plastic-eating bacteria is not a cure-all.

00:08:38.667 --> 00:08:42.933
But given the current statistics,
it's clear that we humans,

00:08:42.957 --> 00:08:45.458
we could use a little help
with this problem.

00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:47.559
Because people,

00:08:47.583 --> 00:08:51.268
we possess a pressing problem
of plastic pollution.

00:08:51.292 --> 00:08:55.726
And bacteria might be
a really important part of the solution.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.018
Thank you.

00:08:57.042 --> 00:09:00.000
(Applause)